Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:10.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕組製作 僅供學習交流 禁止用於商業用途
Comment: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:55.05,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:04:04.14,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:18.56,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}飲み込まれた 怪物の胃袋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:26.75,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}あれからずっと 絡みつく錆びた鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:34.41,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}気づかずにいたなら 闇でも怖くなかった
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:42.68,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:57.64,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}切り裂いてその剣で 本当の世界見せて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:09.41,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}猛毒に溶け出して 私でなくなる前に
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:18.09,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 千切れない罪と私を
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:25.18,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}二度ともう戻れない 不条理な目覚めね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:32.85,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 奈落へと連れて行って
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:37.37,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}もう忘れない まだ痛い
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.78,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}君のこと ケシたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:04:04.14,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 這不公的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:18.56,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}被怪物吞食 落入胃中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:26.75,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}自那之後 始終身纏生鏽鎖鏈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:34.41,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}若視而不見 則不畏黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:42.68,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 這不公的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:57.64,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}用那把劍披荊斬棘 讓我看到真實的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:09.41,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}在我被劇毒溶解 失去自我之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:18.09,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 將我與罪孽分離
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:25.18,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}再也無法回頭 這殘酷的甦醒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:32.85,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}親手去打破吧 將我帶入地獄深淵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:37.37,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}無法遺忘 痛無止境
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.78,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}只想將你 一筆抹消
Comment: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:36.11,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.37,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ワルツを踊る
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:06.05,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}この世界でどうか手を離さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:11.36,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何度となく 行き交うかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:15.03,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}愛しさを躱さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:21.05,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつしか秘密が普通へと変わり果てても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:28.04,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは期待していられるかな ねえ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:32.61,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}強がってなくちゃ崩れきって消える
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:37.79,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}魔法とすら呼べないこの願いを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:42.21,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「捨てた方が楽」 多分そうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:46.54,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:51.85,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは 恐れを振り解き 幕は開けて来た
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:22:57.02,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}あの過去はいまと共に在ることを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:01.35,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「忘れた方が楽」 たとえそうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.35,0:23:07.68,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:15.26,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:21.80,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.37,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}跳起華爾茲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:06.05,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在這個世界 請不要鬆開這雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:11.36,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一次又一次 悲傷交匯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:15.03,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}請不要迴避這份愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:21.05,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不知不覺中 秘密已化為尋常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:28.04,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們是否還能心懷期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:32.61,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}若不故作堅強 便會崩塌消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:37.79,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這無法稱為魔法的祈願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:42.21,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使將其捨棄才更輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:46.54,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依舊無止境地描繪螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:51.85,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們拋開恐懼 大幕漸起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:22:57.02,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那段過去如今也與我們同在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:01.35,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使將其忘卻才更輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.35,0:23:07.68,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依舊無止境地描繪螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:15.26,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們的華爾茲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:21.80,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我們的華爾茲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,德國…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,對 德國發生了離奇死亡案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,女王命令我去調查
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,死者的年齡和性別各異 但有一個共同點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伐烏魯夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,伐烏魯夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是…狼人森林？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,傳說踏入森林就會被魔女詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:34.99,zhu,,0,0,0,,你們是什麼人 怎麼進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這個村子裡只有女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 這是幾百年前的裝束啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫齊格琳德·沙利文
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是這座森林的領主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子是哪個地盤的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那我失陪片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我一個人要怎麼應付她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:51.78,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:54.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}黑髮 男人 名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:01:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜下來聽 還是能聽出幾個單字嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.42,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}你 父母 哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}父母…在…不在了 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:09.21,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}！…這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人究竟是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你們知道魔女狩獵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,隨著時代變遷 魔女逐漸被視為異端
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,被人類追殺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,當時 一名魔女為了保護同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,獻祭自己的雙腿 和狼人締結了契約
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以家族有規定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.74,0:01:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要剝奪世代領主的行走能力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,狼 狼人出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的護符呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人發怒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要是不想被狼人大卸八塊 就趕緊滾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,淑女竟在男士的房門外偷聽 實在有些不妥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,請問您有何貴幹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:02:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我說說我所不知道的外面的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.66,0:02:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才很抱歉 我們友好相處吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 這個給你們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,這是防狼人襲擊的護符 回程時戴上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,狼 狼人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我去追狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,請您回房間等待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我居然…在哭？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,惡魔根本沒有會導致流淚的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你見過被詛咒的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,見過 那叫一個慘不忍睹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,臉腫成兩倍大 全身皮膚都溶解了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一個當場就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,另一個人也受了刺激 精神失常了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這…該不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看到狼人的人會被詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果這是真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,塞…巴斯…蒂安…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:59.71,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准雅宋_GBK\blur3\fsp5\fscx95\bord0.5\fs50\b1\3c&H000000&\3a&H6E&\fad(516,522)\pos(1617,892)}那位執事 外借
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,身體…要燒起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是…詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,請救救少爺 沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,請救救少爺 沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,幹什麼 想上我的床？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你們這副樣子是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你們進了森林吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我們甘願受罰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但請您先救救少爺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大小姐 出什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你們兩個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沃爾夫 要做淨化儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去大釜間做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快點 沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把衣服脫下來扔進灶台裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快進入大釜裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼時候進的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大約15分鐘前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 有點懸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沃爾夫 燒水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再多拿些淨化用的藥草
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在我詠唱咒語的時候 把頭也浸到水裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我說可以了之前不要出來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,三位命運女神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,於此接受烏爾德之泉的恩惠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,之後要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要淨化體內
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,餵他喝下藥水 再吐出來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,用這個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺 恕我冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快讓他吐出來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你有沒有噁心想吐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,請救救少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那就再餵一次藥水
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼們 吃飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,別想用盤子那種高級玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,快給我把嘴張開
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,別灑出來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是你們 要是死了就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,多吃點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,父親 母親
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,下一個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那群貴族真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,下手不知輕重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,總有一天 我也會變成那樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的 我會保護你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我還有你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 別把他帶走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 把我擔心壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我都折壽了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:11:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,您感覺怎樣啊 夏爾少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,夏爾？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺 您怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,夏爾不要再痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好黑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,這是哪裡 我好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,您在說什麼 這裡一點也不黑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊的人是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼也看不見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺的眼睛應該是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有沒有人…把燈點亮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,少 少爺的眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你要哭多久啊 真不吉利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定能治好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他那個狀態 我們甚至無法照顧他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這是基茲說的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是我們 塞巴斯蒂安都被他拒絕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺到底怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只准菲尼碰他 也很令人費解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎麼辦 塞巴斯蒂安
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,既然少爺命令我不許碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不可以碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,總而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只能先等沙利文小姐起床 和她商量一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,各位也去休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我有點事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那個詭異的瘴氣已經消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 依然沒有生物的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能會被魔物的瘴氣傷到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那瘴氣和狼人的真面目到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,總之
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是暫住在狼谷 等少爺康復
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這次的對手很克制我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚給您添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我給您準備了上午茶 聊表歉意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,請用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這可真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐 也請嚐嚐這個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼 真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這是最高級的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他的眼睛被瘴氣傷到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺的眼睛還能恢復嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,只有去看看才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不讓任何人接近他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不知為何 他只允許家中的園丁觸碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,原來他喜歡肌肉型和肥胖型的折中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他的喜好果然挺偏激
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人森林的瘴氣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,會讓人的內心虛弱 讓恐懼增長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只允許園丁觸碰 或許有什麼理由
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那少爺或許是在拒絕成年人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺也有自己的隱情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,比起這個 森林的瘴氣究竟是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瘴氣是狼人釋放出的邪惡魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,被瘴氣侵蝕的人會遭到詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,變成像魔物一樣的怪異外形
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,能淨化詛咒的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我這個綠之魔女製作的秘藥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,都說了不要進入森林
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都那樣千叮萬囑了 為什麼要去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.41,0:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人也並不想無故傷人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 沃爾夫拉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你問為什麼要去森林？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我們已經看膩了惡魔和死神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但從未見過狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以很好奇 狼人究竟是什麼樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,總而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能解除少爺的詛咒的 只有您一人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.17,0:16:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐 請您救救少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,為此 我願意聽從您的任何命令
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.85,0:16:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼塞巴斯蒂安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在我給夏爾治療期間
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要當我的執事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,別碰我 不許碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,少爺 這樣亂動會傷到身體的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,煩死了 快滾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也失敗了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然不清楚人類的恢復速度
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多可以痊癒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要是容貌不堪入目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,去服侍女士就不太合適了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在我給夏爾治療期間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你要當我的執事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以啊 大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,這男人都不知道什麼來歷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,難得有來自外界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我有很多事想問他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1600,1060)}大小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(785.6,1060)}我要讓他手把手地 教我各種知識
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,手把手…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,而且沃爾夫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安比你能幹多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要一起學習
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去準備晨起紅茶了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大家早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,村裡的女人會幫忙準備食材
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.19,0:19:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,還有幫大小姐梳妝打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉還沒自我介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫塞巴斯蒂安 暫時擔任沙利文小姐的執事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫希爾黛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我們會在這裡叨擾一陣子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果需要男性幫忙 還請儘管吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的工作安排如下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,巴魯托去把早餐的食材處理好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.35,0:19:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,SNAKE負責擦拭銀器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這是艾米麗說的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,梅琳負責更換床單被套
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尼 你負責照顧少爺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我照顧少爺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,現在能照顧少爺的 也只有你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他吃得下的話 就給他吃點早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他不願意吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就給他喝加了蜂蜜的熱牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,牛奶？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以前…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,用那個最能哄少爺開心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我就去服侍沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,田中先生保持老樣子就行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 請開始工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺他隨時可能咬我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大小姐 該起床了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:41.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准雅宋_GBK\fscx95\fsp5\blur3\bord0.5\fs70\b1\3c&H000000&\3a&H6E&\pos(960,754.67)}那位執事 服侍
